  "releaseNotes": "Kazo OS 3.6.0, changes for app developers:\n- Test an app on a phone on the published trimmed OS. The shared app test harness (build/app-e2e) also installs and opens an app in the mobile shell, through its app drawer and Terminal. Its SHELLS export tells an app's tests that this version supports phones (ADR 0281).\nRelease notes: https://github.com/Kazo-ca/Os/releases/tag/v3.6.0",
